There are many versions of this old classic.  For Patsy and Tom capo the 2nd fret; for Anne capo the 4th fret.  The lyrics and musical pacing here is based on Tom Jones' version because I like how he finishes (although I didn't include the Chieftain's outro).  For Patsy and Anne the lyrics are  slightly different but the music is the same.  Both versions end before the reprise included here.
       

